MtMoon_Cave1_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "...... ...... ......\n"
	.string "It’s been a while {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "...Since I lost to you, I thought\n"
	.string "about what I was lacking with my\l"
	.string "POKéMON...\p"
	.string "And we came up with an answer.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, now we’ll show you!$"

MtMoon_Cave1_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "...... ...... ......\n"
	.string "...You won, fair and square.\p"
	.string "I admit it. But this isn’t the\n"
	.string "end.\p"
	.string "I’m going to be the greatest\n"
	.string "POKéMON trainer ever.\p"
	.string "Because these guys are behind me.\p"
	.string "...Listen, {PLAYER}.\n"
	.string "One of these days I’m going to prove\l"
	.string "how good I am by beating you.$"

MtMoon_Cave1_Text_Trigger1Defeat::
	.string "...... ...... ......\p"
	.string "I thought I raised my POKéMON to be\n"
	.string "the best they could be...\p"
	.string "...But it still wasn’t enough...$"

MtMoon_Cave1_Text_Trigger1Victory::
	.string "Hmm,\n"
	.string "seems my POKéMON are pretty good.$"

